@host = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Get all expenses
GET {{host}}/expenses

### 2. Add Movie night
POST {{host}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Movie night",
  "amount": 18,
  "category": "Fun"
}

### 3. Total of all expenses
GET {{host}}/expenses/total

### 4. Get expense 4 (Movie night)
GET {{host}}/expenses/4

### 5. THE RESTART TEST: stop the API, start it again, then send this
GET {{host}}/expenses
